# Descriptions for ARES_CORES USE_EXPAND flags
a26 - Emulate Atari 2600
cv - Emulate ColecoVision
fc - Emulate Nintendo Famicom / NES (+ Disk System)
gb - Emulate Nintendo Game Boy, Game Boy Color
gba - Emulate Nintendo Game Boy Advance
md - Emulate Sega Mega Drive / Genesis (+ 32X, + CD), Pioneer LaserActive Mega-LD PAC
ms - Emulate Sega Mark III / Master System, Game Gear
msx - Emulate Microsoft MSX, MSX2
myvision - Emulate Nichibutsu My Vision
n64 - Emulate Nintendo 64 (+ 64DD), Seta Aleck 64
ng - Emulate Neo Geo AES / MVS
ngp - Emulate Neo Geo Pocket (+ Color)
pce - Emulate NEC PC-Engine / TurboGrafx (+ CD), SuperGrafx, Pioneer LaserActive LD-ROM² PAC
ps1 - Emulate Sony PlayStation
sfc - Emulate Nintendo Super Famicom / SNES (+ Satellaview, + SuFami Turbo)
sg - Emulate Sega SG-1000
spec - Emulate Sinclair ZX Spectrum
ws - Emulate Bandai WonderSwan, WonderSwan Color, Benesse Pocket Challenge V2